From 359386cce1718be15277ddd6bb2225e6ca0e6058 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:57:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Foundation before chapter 38: close item 48 (Aeroe), fix
 tidy's Part I blindness, correct item 75

- tidy.py: build_part_i.py added to BUILDS; ch37 was invisible, its three
  figures reported as orphans and its body absent from the bodies table.
- Aeroe, item 48: fault measured on ALL SEVEN maps, not four (1397 spine
  carries the same lobe). DENMARK's southern lobe re-threaded between
  Aeroe and Langeland; AERO ring added, AERO_SL 1397-1814, AERO_DK 1864;
  21 curated cases. Aeroe 4/9 -> 0/9 in DENMARK, 9/9 in AERO.
- Slesvig label sat on Aeroe on five maps; new position computed by search
  over the duchy interior, not typed. (9.20, 54.85), clean on all five.
- M.check() wired into the six map scripts that never called it (item 41).
- HANDOFF item 75: 7,896 -> 7,902; outstanding cut is 28 page words, not 22.
- New items 76-81, including the negative result on items 53 and 60.
